  "summary": "Scalability versus high availability, then the four Elastic Load Balancing types: ALB for layer 7 HTTP routing, NLB for layer 4 TCP/UDP with static IPs, GWLB for inline security appliances and the legacy CLB. Covers health checks, security group chaining, sticky sessions, cross-zone load balancing, TLS certificates with SNI and deregistration delay.",
